# Worker health needs no secrets. /api/tmdb reads these bindings per request.
# Copy to .dev.vars locally; use Worker secrets in Cloudflare.
# Prefer the TMDB read access token; API key remains supported as an alternative.
# TMDB_READ_ACCESS_TOKEN=replace-with-your-tmdb-read-access-token
# TMDB_API_KEY=replace-with-your-tmdb-api-key
# TMDB_BASE_URL=https://api.themoviedb.org/3
# SECRET_KEY=replace-with-a-generated-secret
# Hyperdrive will supply database bindings; never put DB credentials in VITE_*.
# Only for wrangler.db-probe.jsonc on a confirmed development database:
# DB_PROBE_TOKEN=replace-with-a-random-development-probe-secret
# The normal Worker has no diagnostic routes. See docs/DATABASE_RUNTIME.md.
